  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_01",
      "hash64": "086DAA5945746551",
      "text": "È permesso?[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_02",
      "hash64": "086DA75945746038",
      "text": "Oh! Mi faccia indovinare... Lei è [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0202)]illa nuov[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa alliev[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)], dico bene?[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0202"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_03",
      "hash64": "086DA859457461EB",
      "text": "Le chiedo scusa per il ritardo. So che non vede\\nl’ora di immatricolarsi nella nostra accademia...[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_04",
      "hash64": "086DAD5945746A6A",
      "text": "Ah, ma che sbadato! Non mi sono ancora\\npresentato.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_05",
      "hash64": "086DAE5945746C1D",
      "text": "Io sono Clavel, il Preside dell’Accademia\\nArancia.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_11",
      "hash64": "08712E5945777B74",
      "text": "Io sono Clavel, il Preside dell’Accademia Uva.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_0040_mama_01",
      "hash64": "CEBAA8BB4FF1BD84",
      "text": "Oh, signor Preside, non c’era bisogno di venire\\ndi persona![VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_06",
      "hash64": "086DAB5945746704",
      "text": "Sono responsabile dell’intera accademia, e ciò\\nsignifica che devo farmi carico di ogni errore.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_07",
      "hash64": "086DAC59457468B7",
      "text": "Comunque, ecco qui i documenti necessari per\\nl’immatricolazione, nonché una spiegazione\\r\\nsulle varie strutture del nostro istituto.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_0040_mama_02",
      "hash64": "CEBAABBB4FF1C29D",
      "text": "La ringrazio, ma davvero, non c’era bisogno...[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_0040_mama_03",
      "hash64": "CEBAAABB4FF1C0EA",
      "text": "Beh, visto che ormai è qui, posso offrirle\\nuna bella tazza di tè?[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_08",
      "hash64": "086DA15945745606",
      "text": "Ma no, non si scomodi...[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_0040_mama_04",
      "hash64": "CEBAA5BB4FF1B86B",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)], la mamma ha un paio di cose\\nda discutere con il Preside.[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_0040_mama_05",
      "hash64": "CEBAA4BB4FF1B6B8",
      "text": "Tu vai pure [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]in camera tua[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] e preparati per\\nla scuola! Mi raccomando, non dimenticare\\r\\nlo zaino e il cappello, va bene?[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_0040_mama_06",
      "hash64": "CEBAA7BB4FF1BBD1",
      "text": "Suvvia, signor Preside, insisto![VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_09",
      "hash64": "086DA259457457B9",
      "text": "In tal caso... non vedo come potrei rifiutare\\ntanta gentilezza.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_10",
      "hash64": "08712F5945777D27",
      "text": "La sua camera è al piano di sopra, giusto?\\nNon faccia caso a me, vada pure.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "common_0040_mama_07",
      "hash64": "CEBAA6BB4FF1BA1E",
      "text": "Vai pure [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]in camera tua[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] e preparati per la scuola!\\nMi raccomando, non dimenticare lo zaino\\r\\ne il cappello, va bene?[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
